---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { UuidGeneratorTool } from "../../components/tools/UuidGeneratorTool";
import "../../components/tools/tool-surface.css";
const title = "UUID Generator";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description="Generate RFC 9562 UUIDv4 and UUIDv7 values locally.">
  <article class="tool-page">
    <header class="tool-heading"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Workbench</a> / Developer</nav><p class="eyebrow">Developer</p><h1>{title}</h1><p class="lede">Generate RFC 9562 UUIDv4 and UUIDv7 values locally.</p><div class="trust-strip" role="note"><strong>Runs on this device.</strong><span>Randomness comes from Web Crypto on this device.</span></div></header>
    <UuidGeneratorTool client:load />
    <section class="method-card"><p class="eyebrow">Method</p><h2>RFC 9562 version and variant bits</h2><p>UUIDv4 uses cryptographically secure random bytes. UUIDv7 uses a UTC millisecond timestamp plus random bits. A seed is available only as an explicit test input.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
